<title>NIGERIA: CFAO Nigeria half-yr profit lower.</title>
<headline>CFAO Nigeria half-yr profit lower.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year result for Nigerian conglomerate CFAO to end-June. (In million naira)</p>
<p>				  1996	   1995</p>
<p>Turnover		    4,000    vs    3,500</p>
<p>Profit before taxation    151.8  vs	275.9</p>
<p>Taxation			 48.6  vs	102</p>
<p>Profit after taxation     103.2  vs	173.8</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said general lack of demand affected profits but added that there was slight improvement over the first quarter's result.</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
